Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:05.36,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Monsters are surging\Nin the forests of Girtonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:06.94,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}People are getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.59,0:00:10.99,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Philia, my sister, I ask for your guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:13.73,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't rely on Prince Julius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:17.91,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}He doesn't care a whit for this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.91,0:00:20.91,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he did, he'd never have sold you—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:31.94,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was wondering if you've perchance\Nnoticed the ongoing abnormalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:35.43,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}As I've heard nothing from you,\N I thought I might write to you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.43,0:00:38.18,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hope this missive finds you well...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:43.10,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is there any point in doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.09,0:00:50.56,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}If she's noticed the abnormalities, \Nsurely she would have sent guidance by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:52.70,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The fact that she hasn't means...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:58.37,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Big Sister, I hope...\N you're not suffering, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:02.38,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Do you have anyone there on your side?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:26.87,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(710,1)\blur4\t(1,710,\blur0)\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&HDA8FA9&}The Too-Perfect Saint: Tossed Aside\Nby My Fiancé and Sold to Another Kingdom
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.87,0:01:26.87,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(960,1)\an8\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&H884FD9&\3c&HFCFEFE&}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&H9B9999&}: {\c&HDEC58D&}Tossed {\c&HDDBF93&}Aside\N{\c&HE2B99A&}by {\c&HC8ACAD&}My {\c&HDDB3B4&}Fiancé {\c&HDCBAC3&}and {\c&HD79BB3&}Sold {\c&HCEA8CE&}to {\c&HD4A8D5&}Another {\c&HC3A8E2&}Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:38.55,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\shad1\bord0\fnGeorgia\fs10\c&HF9F8FA&\3c&H4E4E4E&\4c&H252526&\pos(540,283.044)}Episode 4\N{\fs12}"Feelings {\fs12\c&HCCC930&}Entrusted{\fs10\c&HFBFFFF&\4c&H6A6763&}"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:51.63,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Quite a number of people are watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.63,0:02:54.51,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Sorry to make a spectacle out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.51,0:02:59.20,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,My father said it was a good chance \Nto introduce the people to the our new saint
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:01.74,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,and opened the event to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:08.75,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I'll admit it's efficient and word \Nwill get around fast, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.75,0:03:10.56,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:13.42,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness. I'm not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.85,0:03:15.71,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.14,0:03:18.83,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I'm told of the work you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:23.00,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,I can see bringing you here \Nwas the right decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:26.01,Default,Reichardt,0,0,0,,It was worth the fight with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.01,0:03:27.85,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,B-Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:30.39,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Did you have to bring that up {\i1}now{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:33.90,Default,Bjorn,0,0,0,,Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:35.68,Default,Bjorn,0,0,0,,Everything is in place!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:37.09,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Ah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.09,0:03:39.23,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:42.70,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.33,0:03:47.53,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I leave our kingdom in your capable hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.27,0:04:02.59,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're all such nice people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:06.35,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perfectly earnest, with great \Nlove for their kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:10.91,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're kind and have generous hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:16.94,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even though I wasn't born here, \NI want to protect these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:24.54,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to stay the saint of Parnacorta.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:26.95,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I shall begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:35.96,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Lives that sprout and grow from the soil...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:38.72,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Lives that fly high into the sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:41.46,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Hear and convey my prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.69,0:04:46.84,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Mom, the saint is like a goddess!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.15,0:04:50.35,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Saint Philia is so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:52.95,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Let the pillar of protection \Ngrow from the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:56.35,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,and the purifying light give its love to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.89,0:05:01.02,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I swear an oath that as long \Nas my will remains true,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:04.24,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,nothing shall penetrate this barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:22.92,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Great Purification Circle.... activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:39.92,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,It's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:41.44,Main - Italics,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I've found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:43.57,Main - Italics,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I've found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:46.92,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}What in the world was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.45,Default,Nuns,0,0,0,,Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:49.87,Default,Nun A,0,0,0,,You did great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:50.91,Default,Nun B,0,0,0,,Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:53.74,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,That was great! Just great, Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.74,0:05:55.21,Default,Citizens,0,0,0,,Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:56.25,Main - Top,Citizens,0,0,0,,You're wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:56.25,Main - Top,Citizens,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:14.99,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Isn't the weather just lovely today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:17.92,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Parnacorta is the picture \Nof peace and tranquility!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.07,Default,Greengrocer,0,0,0,,Lena!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:22.36,Default,Greengrocer,0,0,0,,Some vegetables! Take them to the saint!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:25.36,Default,Wholesaler,0,0,0,,Eggs give you strength! \NTake them to the saint!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.57,Default,Sweets Seller,0,0,0,,I made Saint Philia pastries!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:27.59,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(420,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs20\bord1\c&H9ADEFF&\3c&H658CD6&\4c&HE5E5FF&\move(197.515,72,210,35)}Mm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:30.07,Default,Farmer,0,0,0,,Take some fruit from our farm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:32.24,Default,Housewife,0,0,0,,I knitted this scarf just for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:34.81,Default,Merchant,0,0,0,,Take our latest facial powder to the saint!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:37.41,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I can't carry all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:50.80,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:54.14,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,You're working again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.41,0:07:01.65,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Goodness, I told you to at least take\N a break while you can't leave the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:04.40,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Just get some rest already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:05.98,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:09.40,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I just didn't know what else to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:16.21,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,You don't have any hobbies or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:27.80,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Not in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:30.08,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,That's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:33.05,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Then how about we take a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:39.06,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(310,1)\bord1.5\an8\fnArial\b1\c&HCD4B80&\3c&HFFE5F3&\4c&H432339&\pos(312.768,93.904)}It's Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:37.19,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Though you're bound to be mobbed by \Nfans hungry for more Saint Philia,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:39.06,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,so maybe that's not the best idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:40.70,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,A walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.70,0:07:42.30,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Gardening!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:43.76,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Gardening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:46.06,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I hear fishing is nice, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:47.61,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Fishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:52.57,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Well, what about reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.57,0:07:55.10,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Ah, I do read often.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:58.29,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I decipher ancient texts \Nand study scientific textbooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:01.87,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I love reading, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.28,0:08:04.79,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Romance novels are my favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:09.55,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an8\c&HDAB8FA&\3c&H533A6C&\4c&HFAFDF9&}Romance novels?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:09.09,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Ro-manse-no-vells?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:13.31,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Wait, you don't know what \Nromance novels are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:16.30,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Well, I haven't read any, \Nbut I do know about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:21.48,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,They're psychological profiles of couples \Nengaged in mutual affection, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:25.87,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,That somehow feels so close and so far...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:31.80,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Say, are you not at all interested\Nin romance yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.05,0:08:34.22,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I suppose not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:35.99,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,But you're so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:38.74,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,It's more that I've never had the chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:46.42,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll lend you some \Nof my favorite romance novels!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:51.63,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I'll bring you my very favorite, \Nso I hope you'll tell me what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:55.26,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll be eager to read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:57.31,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Things sound lively in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.81,0:09:01.38,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Your Highness! Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:06.90,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I was hoping to discuss something \Nwith you, Miss Philia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:20.41,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Before I get to the matter at hand, \NI feel I owe you an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.82,0:09:25.61,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,It's about the fight my brother \Nand I had over bringing you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.61,0:09:28.66,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Yes, I recall he mentioned it at the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:30.71,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You shouldn't let it bother—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.71,0:09:32.21,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,It does bother me, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:37.72,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,It isn't that I didn't want you\N to come here or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:40.54,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,But as I told you before,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:44.56,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I was against the idea of buying\N a saint like some sort of commodity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:49.02,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,My brother was already \Non edge for other reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:51.12,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,and we both lost our cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:56.95,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,To be honest, I still think \Nit's wrong to buy someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:09:59.03,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I never want to do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.03,0:10:01.68,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,But I'm still glad I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.53,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Those are my genuine feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:07.62,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,I wanted to make that clear \Nso there would be no misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:11.38,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:12.63,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:15.38,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Pardon, Your Highness. What did \Nyou want to discuss with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:18.63,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Leonardo, not the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:20.31,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.13,0:10:24.43,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Miss Philia, I've been wanting to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.17,0:10:26.93,Default,Osvalt,0,0,0,,Would you like to try being a tutor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:32.48,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I think it's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:36.99,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure if I can \Nbe an effective mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:40.00,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,You're so great at teaching, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.00,0:10:44.95,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,When I ask about your duties, you always \Ngive such easy-to-understand explanations!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.22,0:10:52.14,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm sure a saint-in-training \Nwould make a great companion for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.14,0:10:57.33,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,He said she's younger than you,\Nbut I bet it won't be by much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:05.11,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Saint Philia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.11,0:11:08.63,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I was thinking of my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.36,0:11:13.05,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I sent her a letter, \Nbut I've received no reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:17.31,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,I'll check to make sure \Nthe messenger did his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:19.07,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Now here you are, Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:22.22,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Help yourself to dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:30.75,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,It's very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.32,0:11:36.16,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.16,0:11:42.01,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Sorry, we're just delighted \Nto hear you say that you like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.75,0:11:45.43,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Oh? Could it be you haven't realized?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:48.24,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,In the past, you always ate in silence,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:51.99,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,but lately you've been \Ntelling us how you feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:57.06,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I'm sure it makes all Leonardo's \Nwork feel more worthwhile, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:12:01.61,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,I've endeavored to expand my repertoire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:03.68,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:09.08,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Can you believe it? Leonardo's been \Nthe one cooking your meals recently!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:10.70,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Just a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:13.66,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,You always cook this delicious food for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:15.63,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,We aren't the only ones contributing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:19.98,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Everything on this table, from the vegetables\N to the fruit, meat, and eggs,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.98,0:12:25.38,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,was sent to us by the people out \Nof gratitude for what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:27.60,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Even the flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.36,0:12:34.37,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,It almost feels like we're \Ndining with the whole kingdom, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.37,0:12:38.47,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I always think food tastes better \Nwhen you eat with someone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.98,0:12:42.86,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I see. I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:49.18,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Exchanging books with someone,\Nthe improvement of a meal with company...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:51.62,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've long been alone,\Nso these are things I've never known.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:53.98,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Saint Philia?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:01.30,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Leonardo. Lena.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:04.71,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.83,0:13:07.43,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,It's quite delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:13.23,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,How is it, Mia?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:15.56,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:17.89,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,It is, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.89,0:13:22.64,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,I brought in the finest \Ningredients just for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:27.54,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Once we're wed, you'll be able \Nto feast like this every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:32.66,Default,Julius,0,0,0,,Oh, you're just so dainty and precious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.03,0:13:36.79,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Saint Philia! Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.79,0:13:39.20,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Lena? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:41.42,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I wanted to give it to you straight away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:46.68,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,It's a letter from the Kingdom of Girtonia,\N sent by Mia Adenauer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:51.18,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:55.17,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:59.98,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnGeorgia\b1\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H884FD9&\pos(323,110)}The Too-Perfect Saint{\c&H9B9999&}: {\c&HDEC58D&}Tossed {\c&HDDBF93&}Aside\N{\c&HE2B99A&}by {\c&HC8ACAD&}My {\c&HDDB3B4&}Fiancé {\c&HDCBAC3&}and {\c&HD79BB3&}Sold {\c&HCEA8CE&}to {\c&HD4A8D5&}Another {\c&HC3A8E2&}Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:04.73,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,The letter you sent never \Nreached her, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.73,0:14:05.87,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:11.13,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Mia says she's written to me\Nbecause she hasn't heard from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:18.04,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,But Parnacorta's royal messenger assured \Nme he delivered it to the Adenauer estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:22.66,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,My parents must have destroyed it\Nbefore it reached Mia's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.66,0:14:27.77,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I believe they may want to cut \Noff contact between the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.77,0:14:29.09,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,That's awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:31.51,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,It is upsetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:42.08,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Saint Philia, you'd like a way to ensure\Nyour letters reach Saint Mia, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:44.07,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I do, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:47.76,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,In that case, I think we can get it done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:48.40,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:51.91,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Are you present, Himari?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:52.84,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:54.46,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:57.41,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Allow me to make introductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.41,0:14:59.03,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,This is Himari.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:04.79,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,She is another member of your personal \Nguard assigned by the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.79,0:15:10.99,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,A real shock, right? \NHimari has been at your side all this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:13.01,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,What? Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:15.52,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Since the day you arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:18.94,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:21.78,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Your surprise is understandable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:22.64,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:24.11,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Because you see, Himari is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:26.27,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,a ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:27.90,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,A ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:30.28,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,I've heard of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:33.91,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,They are warriors from the island kingdom \Nof Murasame to the northeast
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:36.16,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,who specialize in stealth and reconnaissance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.47,0:15:39.14,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Himari, I'm sure you've been listening in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:42.25,Default,Leonardo,0,0,0,,Can you take a letter directly to Saint Mia?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:43.64,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:45.25,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,On the name of the Fuuma clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.06,0:15:54.24,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,To enter Girtonia now will require\N traversing forests swarming with monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:58.82,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,The people trying to keep Mia and I \Napart may also attempt to hinder you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:02.40,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Himari?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:05.90,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Saint Philia, you may issue me \Nthe order without reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.30,0:16:11.39,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,From the shadows, I have witnessed\Nyour attempts to save this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.89,0:16:14.70,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,For you, I am prepared to risk my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:19.20,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,In that case, Himari...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:20.11,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:24.67,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Will you take a letter to my sister, Mia?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:26.46,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Be prudent, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:30.21,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,If you're at risk of discovery, \Ndon't hesitate to flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.44,0:16:32.38,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:34.22,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,If it seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:39.97,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,If it seems like it might \Nbe possible, then please...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:43.64,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:48.72,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Please protect my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.72,0:16:52.69,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,If it seems likely something will befall \Nher, take her with you and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.06,0:16:53.89,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.98,0:16:58.45,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,It shall be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:06.52,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,That's the final pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:08.96,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Now, once I get the barrier up...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:12.91,Default,Girtonian Soldier,0,0,0,,Amazing work, Saint Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:15.76,Default,Girtonian Soldier,0,0,0,,You complete rituals even \Nfaster than Saint Philia!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:19.05,Default,Girtonian Soldier,0,0,0,,You're filling in for her like it's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.05,0:17:23.73,Default,Girtonian Soldier,0,0,0,,We'd gladly give our lives to protect \Na saint as wonderful as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:26.05,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}They make it sound easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.05,0:17:27.86,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:32.36,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's true that I'm faster \Nwith rituals than my sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.36,0:17:34.36,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:38.24,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}My barriers are far more fragile than hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:41.86,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}Were a large number\N of monsters to spawn at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:43.37,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}they would shatter it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:47.96,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}To prevent that, I'm forced \Nto forge additional layers of barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:50.87,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that consequently takes longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.87,0:17:52.57,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}They have no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:55.22,Default,Girtonian Soldier,0,0,0,,Saint Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:57.13,Default,Girtonian Soldier,0,0,0,,Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:58.59,Default,Girtonian Soldier,0,0,0,,A ton of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.59,0:18:01.81,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}No! How could I not\N have noticed them closing in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:05.77,Default,Girtonian Soldier,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:07.34,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:08.27,Default,Girtonian Soldier,0,0,0,,Saint Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:09.27,Default,Girtonian Soldier,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.27,0:18:11.02,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Silver...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:12.98,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:18.74,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I knew it. Something's not right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:20.53,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Silver Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.80,0:18:35.21,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I'm not sure who's guarding whom...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.69,0:18:40.87,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Saint Mia, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.87,0:18:41.90,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:44.70,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,It appears the monsters \Nare vanquished for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:46.43,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Please use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.43,0:18:48.64,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:52.06,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a considerate young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:55.74,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}This handwriting...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:56.94,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Please—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:02.77,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Is my sister well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.77,0:19:04.56,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,You have no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:08.54,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,My mistress, Lady Philia, \Nis doing well in Parnacorta.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.03,0:19:14.36,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,We are most indebted to Saint Philia,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:16.67,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,but our affection for her \Ngoes even beyond that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:19.49,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,so we wish to assist her in any way we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:21.47,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,That is why I was sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.80,0:19:24.05,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.05,0:19:28.72,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}My sister is with people who care about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.72,0:19:32.44,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}You've found some wonderful\N company, Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:34.61,Main - Top,Girtonian Soldiers,0,0,0,,Saint Mia! Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:34.61,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.68,0:19:38.64,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I'll leave my door unlocked this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.64,0:19:40.81,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Could we talk a little bit longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.81,0:19:42.11,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Including about this letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.51,0:19:49.25,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:51.28,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,I shall speak with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:19:57.75,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:08.77,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Himari, reporting as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:12.81,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I certainly didn't expect you \Nto jump down from the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.81,0:20:15.79,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,It was a necessary measure \Nto elude the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:16.96,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:18.90,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:21.26,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,So you're a lady, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.26,0:20:25.11,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,The art of disguise is a crucial \Nskill for going undetected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.11,0:20:27.08,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Have you read the letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:29.08,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Yes, many times!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.36,0:20:31.84,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Thank you, Himari.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:34.98,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I now understand the threat \Nfacing our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:37.96,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Saint Philia says it is a race against time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:43.03,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,She went and did that ancient ritual, did she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.03,0:20:44.47,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,Wish I coulda seen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.47,0:20:46.80,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,It was truly a splendid sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:51.06,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not something I could pull off, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:55.68,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,So I'll have to muster \Nall the kingdom's forces, will I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.68,0:20:57.36,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:21:00.07,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Saint Philia was concerned \Nabout that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.55,0:21:04.72,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,It's just... that louse of a prince \Nis the one in charge right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.72,0:21:07.32,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,He only cares about himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.86,0:21:15.95,Flashback - Italics,Philia,0,0,0,,Please, my sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.27,0:21:18.55,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Would you like to escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:24.59,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,I could easily take one person to Parnacorta.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.59,0:21:27.14,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Saint Philia is worried about you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.19,0:21:30.39,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,This is your chance to get to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:32.39,Default,Himari,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:36.89,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I take her hand, I get to see my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.85,0:21:42.64,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}What reason do I have to stay here...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.64,0:21:47.03,Default,Mia,0,0,0,,{\i1}in this kingdom that scorned \Nand exiled my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:32.64,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Too-Perfect Saint: Tossed Aside by \NMy Fiancé and Sold to Another Kingdom{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.40,0:23:35.01,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,Next time, episode 5:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.02,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\shad1\bord0\fs18\fnGeorgia\c&HFBFFFF&\3c&H4E4E4E&\4c&H6A6763&\pos(320,67.102)\b1}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.02,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\shad1\bord0\fs14\fnGeorgia\c&HFBFFFF&\3c&H4E4E4E&\4c&H6A6763&\b1\pos(320,120.348)}Episode 5
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.02,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\shad1\bord0\an8\fnGeorgia\c&HFBFFFF&\3c&H4E4E4E&\fs20\4c&H6A6763&\b1\pos(320,250)}"Golden {\fs24\c&H35BBE5&\4c&HFFFFFF&}Freesia{\fs20\c&HFBFFFF&\4c&H6A6763&}"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:37.85,Default,Philia,0,0,0,,"Golden Freesia."
